#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-pivot-turns.rst:5
#: b16969a231cb4bbdb34e4a806bed495b
msgid "Tuning Pivot Turns"
msgstr "原地转向调参"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-pivot-turns.rst:10
#: 45a3ee20144946dd8f3ed68bbd1e28ae
msgid ""
"This page describes how to tune the \"pivot turn\" feature on a Rover (or "
"boat) with :ref:`skid-steering <rover-motor-and-servo-configuration>`."
msgstr ""
"本页介绍如何在具有 :ref:`差速转向 <rover-motor-and-servo-configuration>` 的 "
"Rover（或船）上调节「原地转向」功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-pivot-turns.rst:12
#: 136828de2e9a4e59b0cd4f978f78d722
msgid ""
"A pivot turn involves the vehicle slowing or stopping, turning towards the "
"destination and then continuing.  These turns are only triggered in "
":ref:`Auto <auto-mode>`, :ref:`Guided <guided-mode>`, :ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>` "
"or :ref:`SmartRTL <smartrtl-mode>` modes and only as a vehicle first starts "
"towards the next waypoint."
msgstr ""
"原地转向是指车辆减速或停止，转向目标方向后再继续行驶。此类转向仅在 :ref:`Auto <auto-mode>`、:ref:`Guided "
"<guided-mode>`、:ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>` 或 :ref:`SmartRTL <smartrtl-mode>` "
"模式下触发，且仅在车辆首次开始驶向下一航点时触发。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-pivot-turns.rst:15
#: 1a8291217e1446e792f97c6646832965
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-pivot-turns.rst:17
#: 61925d8e8b3c41a69f442d8b1b5c2563
msgid ""
":ref:`WP_PIVOT_ANGLE <WP_PIVOT_ANGLE>` holds the minimum angle error that "
"will trigger a pivot turn.  For example when set to the default of \"60\", a"
" pivot turn will be triggered if the vehicle's heading is at least 60 "
"degrees off from the next waypoint.  This parameter should normally not be "
"set below 30 unless you wish to disable pivot-turns which can be done by "
"setting this parameter to 0.  The vehicle will begin towards the next "
"waypoints once its heading is within 10 degrees of the heading to the "
"destination"
msgstr ""
":ref:`WP_PIVOT_ANGLE <WP_PIVOT_ANGLE>` "
"设定触发原地转向的最小航向误差角。例如，当设为默认值「60」时，若车辆航向与下一航点偏差至少 60 度，则触发原地转向。该参数通常不应低于 "
"30，除非希望禁用原地转向（设为 0 即可禁用）。车辆航向与目标方向偏差在 10 度以内时，将开始驶向下一航点。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-pivot-turns.rst:18
#: 97fde2670a87405db2ca442a4358b938
msgid ""
":ref:`WP_PIVOT_RATE <WP_PIVOT_RATE>` holds the maximum turn rate of the "
"vehicle (in degrees per second) during a pivot turn"
msgstr ":ref:`WP_PIVOT_RATE <WP_PIVOT_RATE>` 设定车辆在原地转向期间的最大转向速率（单位：度/秒）"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-pivot-turns.rst:19
#: 1975fe3b988c4df881e0d6bb05896e81
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_STR_ANG_P <ATC_STR_ANG_P>` converts the vehicle's heading error "
"into a desired turn rate.  Higher values lead to a more aggressive turn "
"towards the destination."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ATC_STR_ANG_P <ATC_STR_ANG_P>` 将车辆航向误差转换为目标转向速率。较高的值将使车辆更积极地转向目标方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-pivot-turns.rst:20
#: 9c42f2a66bc547a4be8eeaf3634a6336
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_STR_RAT_MAX <ATC_STR_RAT_MAX>` limits the vehicle's maximum turn "
"rate (in degrees per second) in all modes including during pivot turns."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ATC_STR_RAT_MAX <ATC_STR_RAT_MAX>` 限制车辆在所有模式（包括原地转向）中的最大转向速率（单位：度/秒）。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-pivot-turns.rst:21
#: c57cfe1d48a946bea6bb3d4cf03089c7
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_STR_ACC_MAX <ATC_STR_ACC_MAX>` limits the vehicle's maximum "
"rotational acceleration (in deg/sec/sec) in all modes.  higher numbers lead "
"to the vehicle getting up to its maximum turn rate more quickly"
msgstr ""
":ref:`ATC_STR_ACC_MAX <ATC_STR_ACC_MAX>` "
"限制车辆在所有模式中的最大旋转加速度（单位：度/秒/秒）。较高的值使车辆更快达到最大转向速率。"

